 "notes": "Punjabi (Gurmukhi): neutral polite imperative (-ੋ) for buttons, verbal noun (-ਣਾ) for undo names. Terms follow the file: ਟੈਕਸਟ, ਕੀਬੋਰਡ, ਕਲਿੱਪਬੋਰਡ, ਕਟਲਿੰਗ (invariant plural). Loanwords for Notes/Shortcuts terms (ਫ਼ਾਰਮੈਟ, ਇਟੈਲਿਕ, ਵੇਰੀਏਬਲ). Unsure: ਕੱਲ੍ਹ means both tomorrow and yesterday, so PK8/PK9 use ਆਉਣ ਵਾਲਾ/ਬੀਤਿਆ; PK10 'ਹਫ਼ਤੇ ਬਾਅਦ' (one week implied) is short for budget."
